WEBVTT

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.260
Lost in the direction of a vast road ahead

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:27.300
Want to escape the cycle, be myself for once

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.400
Crashing into a chaotic world

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.690
Ever since I met you, my course has changed

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:40.940
Define the world as infinity

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.460
No need to be suspicious

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.160
No need to doubt

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:49.500
You're light, I'm darkness, in mutual opposition

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.780
Like the opposite ends of magnets

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:53.740
In natural tacit agreement

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:57.480
Quarrel gets reconciled in split seconds

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:02.420
Can't see and can't hear in subtlety

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:07.720
You know what I'm thinking

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:11.980
Your trust is burning

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:17.060
is my smiling response to the world

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:19.360
Relying on each other

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:21.960
Vast potential to rewrite life

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:23.860
May be unexpected

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:25.820
In every circumstance

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:33.500
To face all battles together

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.400
Let the chains that bound us together

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:40.340
Converge into an unlimited, exciting

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:45.520
Splendor

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:49.440
Soul Contract

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:54.200
Fifth Contract

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:58.690
Subbed by EP of Bayi Subs

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:04.820
Duanmu Xi

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:06.160
You've no sense of direction

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:09.050
You drove whole day for a 2-hour journey

00:02:09.055 --> 00:02:10.960
We'd see Potala Palace by noon

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:14.463
By the way, where are you taking us?

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:17.460
All this while, your home isn't in the city

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:18.380
You live so far

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:19.940
You ain't so privileged, eh?

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:21.200
Any more crap from you,

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.400
I'll beat you into a beautiful scenery

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:26.880
You have long hair but your wit is short

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.180
Since we entered here,

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:30.540
we're already at Duanmu's home

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:33.690
because this mountain belongs to them

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:36.230
My goodness

00:02:36.236 --> 00:02:39.083
This is a freaking world heritage!

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:45.930
Young master is back

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:50.940
Master Xi has brought along a human spirit, hasn't he?

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:51.760
You mean

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:53.880
the master has accepted a Soul Image

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.080
Did you hear?

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:57.600
Master Xi is back

00:02:57.602 --> 00:02:59.539
He even brings home a boyfriend

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:00.920
Sisters

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:03.130
Let's go catch the buzz

00:03:10.782 --> 00:03:12.344
We're in the same business

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:14.840
but why our living conditions contrast so much?

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.860
Look at this 5-star hotel design

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:18.420
Author, you design it so grand

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.880
Aren't you jealous of it?

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:21.810
Welcome home, Master Xi

00:03:21.814 --> 00:03:23.625
You must be tired

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.500
I've requested preparations for you refreshments

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:28.540
You must go rest quickly

00:03:28.549 --> 00:03:30.438
Dinner will be ready

00:03:30.691 --> 00:03:31.388
Sure

00:03:31.388 --> 00:03:32.389
Thanks

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:33.740
Mamma mia!

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:35.620
Why does he have a real butler

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.900
but I only get a downloaded butler program?

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.170
So unfair

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:41.870
Young Master Xi

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:44.070
My gosh!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:46.180
A flock of beautiful harem too?

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:48.100
It's been days, you look slimmer

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:49.970
Young Master Xi, you've returned

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:51.680
but you look more dashing now

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.900
Here, take the meatloaves to curb hunger

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.440
Have a sip of green tea first

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:56.220
Curb hunger first

00:03:56.220 --> 00:03:57.920
I'm so thirsty and hungry

00:03:57.920 --> 00:03:59.730
No one cares for me?

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:04.370
Why is Duanmu born with a silver spoon in his mouth

00:04:04.376 --> 00:04:06.878
while I get to be a dejected crummy guy?

00:04:06.878 --> 00:04:08.295
Speaking of which,

00:04:08.295 --> 00:04:11.859
there must be someone else who's edgier than me about this, right?

00:04:14.514 --> 00:04:15.951
Hello, compatriot

00:04:15.951 --> 00:04:18.611
How about we form a league of The Forgotten Ones?

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:19.470
Wait

00:04:19.472 --> 00:04:20.858
That art style isn't right

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:22.680
Why is she smiling so graciously?

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:24.840
Watching her fiancé surrounded by girls

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:26.690
Is she seriously not fuming?

00:04:27.125 --> 00:04:28.279
Ridiculous

00:04:28.279 --> 00:04:30.205
If I don't have this much tolerance,

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.740
how can I become Duanmu Xi's queen?

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.710
I didn't expect you could hold it

00:04:34.719 --> 00:04:36.125
What the hell?

00:04:37.498 --> 00:04:38.905
Voodoo dolls?

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:43.290
Dare to compete with me?

00:04:43.292 --> 00:04:46.542
I'll make you all suffer terribly

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:48.260
When a woman gets sinister

00:04:48.261 --> 00:04:49.998
there's no escape

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:54.960
I wonder

00:04:54.965 --> 00:04:57.136
what's with all the commotion

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.870
Turns out young Master Xi has returned

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.440
Who's this?

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:04.160
I'm only here to check on young Master Xi

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:06.830
Who knows what kind of trouble he got himself into

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.900
or what kind of pain he's dealing with

00:05:08.900 --> 00:05:10.420
I guess you worried too much

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.350
Li

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:12.500
What's with you?

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.300
Speaking to the master, half-naked

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:15.440
Where's your manner?

00:05:16.618 --> 00:05:17.503
Sorry

00:05:17.503 --> 00:05:19.096
Ain't I over excited

00:05:19.096 --> 00:05:21.689
I heard he accepted Soul Image for the first time

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:23.500
I thought I'd rush over to take a look

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.040
Enough with the farce, guys

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:26.120
Everyone's here

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:28.480
just to see what's the jive, isn't it?

00:05:28.704 --> 00:05:30.439
Though I get the recognition

00:05:30.439 --> 00:05:32.784
but why the mood gets more unsettling?

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:33.720
You imbecile!

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.730
How can you speak this way to the master?

00:05:35.737 --> 00:05:37.767
Why are you agitated?

00:05:37.767 --> 00:05:40.866
Have you forgotten what the Master Xi did before?

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:41.820
Therefore,

00:05:41.829 --> 00:05:45.345
we should be extremely wary of every decision he made

00:05:45.345 --> 00:05:47.424
A slight blunder

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:50.180
may cause us great tragic

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:51.020
Silence!

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:52.190
Butler Situ

00:05:52.408 --> 00:05:53.689
Leave him be

00:05:53.689 --> 00:05:55.300
Just let him speak

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:56.879
as he pleased

00:05:57.081 --> 00:05:58.835
I just want to hear

00:05:58.835 --> 00:06:02.157
what kind of tragedy happened to our Duanmu household

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:04.020
that makes you feel so troubled

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:05.980
and engrossed in it

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.780
Greetings, Second Lady

00:06:09.654 --> 00:06:10.889
Second Lady?

00:06:10.889 --> 00:06:12.892
Duanmu Xi is the Master

00:06:12.892 --> 00:06:13.954
Lemme guess

00:06:13.954 --> 00:06:15.749
Dad's dad is granddad

00:06:15.749 --> 00:06:17.546
Mom's mom is maternal grandma

00:06:17.540 --> 00:06:18.940
Dad's younger brother is uncle

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:20.660
Mom's younger brother is uncle

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:22.250
Dad's elder brother is uncle

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.046
Mom's elder brother is...

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:27.060
That means

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:29.280
This woman and Duanmu are siblings

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:32.020
No wonder their looks are so refined

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:33.320
Beautiful siblings

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:35.010
Exceptional gene pool

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:36.380
In that case

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:38.380
A beautiful wife embraced in his left

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:40.170
A sexy sister held in his right

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.374
Add that to 3,000 pretty harem

00:06:42.374 --> 00:06:43.594
Duanmu Xi

00:06:43.594 --> 00:06:45.497
You're a natural enemy of all men!

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:48.040
I swear to be your mortal enemy!

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:49.860
She's not Duanmu Xi's sister

00:06:49.861 --> 00:06:51.613
Actually, she's his cousin

00:06:51.613 --> 00:06:53.402
Their relationship

00:06:53.402 --> 00:06:55.387
is like their blood relationship

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:57.460
There's a boundary drawn between them

00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:59.320
It's not as simple as you think

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:00.760
Why are you silent now?

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:03.960
In your house

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:06.397
There's safety in numbers, eh?

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:08.600
God's watching your every move

00:07:08.604 --> 00:07:11.168
What you owe, you'll pay for it one day

00:07:11.499 --> 00:07:12.731
I'm off to take a shower

00:07:12.731 --> 00:07:16.617
Soon, I'll have a great meal to welcome you home

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:19.800
Fine

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:22.520
Don't get yourself caught up in this petty situation

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:23.960
I'm Duanmu Siyun

00:07:23.961 --> 00:07:26.587
He is the Duanmu family eldest son, Duanmu Siming

00:07:26.789 --> 00:07:30.148
It's an honor to meet the master's Soul Image

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:32.300
To be recognized by young Master Xi

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.260
You must be special

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:36.020
Just say it if you got issue with me

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:37.580
Stop beating around the bush

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:39.080
You are head of the family

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:40.830
Would I dare to say it?

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:44.700
Master, Second Lady

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.820
The old lady is calling for dinner

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:48.180
Well then

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:48.900
Everyone

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:49.840
please

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.600
You're the Soul Image?

00:07:52.604 --> 00:07:54.023
Come take a pic with us

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:55.760
I want a pic too

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:57.280
Please help us take a pic each

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.120
Cheese~

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:00.760
Our master has finally found a suitable Soul Image

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.540
Thank our ancestors

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:03.300
Yes

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:03.720
Come

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:05.080
Cheers for the ancestors

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:06.040
Siyao

00:08:06.044 --> 00:08:07.541
How has your father been?

00:08:07.541 --> 00:08:09.030
Don't worry, Ma'am

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:10.100
My dad is fine

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:12.200
He's been asking how you're doing

00:08:12.416 --> 00:08:13.856
I'm doing good

00:08:13.856 --> 00:08:15.699
Tell him not to worry

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:17.160
(Recognition)

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:18.760
As long as I have her attention

00:08:18.765 --> 00:08:21.149
I'll have a position in this household

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.060
Oh yea

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:23.640
Where's little Xi's Soul Image?

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.590
I guess he's a bit shy

00:08:25.595 --> 00:08:26.351
so

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:27.300
Great grandma

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:28.910
I've brought him home

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:32.960
Duanmu Xi

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:33.920
You scum!

00:08:33.920 --> 00:08:35.140
Brushing me aside

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:36.930
and having dinner by yourself

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:38.010
Ma'am

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:39.380
He's not very bright

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:40.800
Please forgive him

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:42.870
Nice meeting you, Ma'am

00:08:42.876 --> 00:08:44.710
I-I'm Yang Jinghua

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:46.818
Dammit, my awkwardness is showing

00:08:46.818 --> 00:08:47.971
Awesome

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:49.760
After waiting for so many years

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:50.810
The hell?

00:08:50.816 --> 00:08:52.377
What is it?

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.920
Our Duanmu household master

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:56.450
finally has a Soul Image

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:57.700
Ma'am, what's wrong?

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:58.480
Nothing

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:00.440
I was too excited

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:03.020
Little Xi's parents passed away early

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:03.720
So

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:06.220
he's been always lonely

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:09.040
W-Wait, something's wrong with this plot development

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:11.310
From now on, I entrust my grandchild to you

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:13.520
I can give his parents the assurance

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:14.390
Good child

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:16.360
Please make this place as your home

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:19.810
Die!Die!Die!Die!Die!Die!

00:09:20.127 --> 00:09:21.518
That's not right

00:09:21.518 --> 00:09:24.298
The one behind you should be your in-law

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.890
Nope

00:09:25.894 --> 00:09:27.691
We should pick a day

00:09:27.691 --> 00:09:28.799
quickly

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:31.300
to arrange for you and little Xi's vows ceremony

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:33.560
Wait

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:35.060
Give me some rice

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:37.860
Let me clear my mind a bit

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.390
Didn't you say

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:47.760
you won't accept Soul Image as long as you live?

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:49.660
Why you change your mind?

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:52.510
This is none of your concern

00:09:52.518 --> 00:09:55.613
Don't forget what you swore

00:09:55.613 --> 00:09:56.524
Don't worry

00:09:56.524 --> 00:09:59.003
If I die, I'll die in this household

00:09:59.003 --> 00:10:00.568
but prior to that,

00:10:00.568 --> 00:10:02.273
the position of Yangming Master,

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.150
Don't you even try

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:10.860
Siyun

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:12.940
You don't have to feel so discouraged

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:14.550
You should be the one...

00:10:16.621 --> 00:10:18.061
Not now

00:10:18.061 --> 00:10:18.934
But

00:10:19.634 --> 00:10:21.742
Don't worry brother Siming

00:10:21.742 --> 00:10:23.586
It doesn't matter how powerful he is

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:25.080
He's at the end of the rope

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:27.410
His time is running out

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:29.360
That Soul Image is quite suspicious

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:30.390
Go find out

00:10:30.398 --> 00:10:32.103
who he really is

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:41.080
Don't tell me this whole block is your room

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:42.820
- This is too extravagant!
- Stop being frantic

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:44.980
Try keep a cool head even if you're naive

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:48.180
Damn, why he gets all the good stuff?

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:49.240
Obviously

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:50.680
The master of Duanmu family

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:52.100
is no ordinary man

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:53.120
Look carefully

00:10:53.120 --> 00:10:56.580
Spirit energy from all directions accumulate on this mountain

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:57.980
An altar is built here

00:10:57.980 --> 00:10:59.780
to harmonize the world's energy

00:10:59.780 --> 00:11:01.340
Stabilizing Yin and Yang

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:02.380
And Duanmu Xi

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:03.420
a.k.a. my hubby

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:06.740
is the greatest man on this altar

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:08.960
The one who's closest to god

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:11.600
He's so damn cool

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:12.960
So he's just a altar dancer

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:14.940
performing on a bigger platform

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.860
If you dare badmouth him

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:19.320
I'll chuck you off the mountain to feed the youkai

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:20.480
Stop scaring him

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:22.200
Follow me and you'll be fine

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:23.198
Alright

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:24.560
You must protect me

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:25.080
Screw you!

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:27.320
This psycho changes her art style so fast

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:29.160
I can't stand it anymore

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:31.140
Yang Jinghua

00:11:31.145 --> 00:11:32.316
Go to my room

00:11:33.256 --> 00:11:36.725
Is this the part where we sleep together?

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:43.840
Apparently, it's same room different bed

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.650
Ew ew ew, what was I thinking?

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:47.820
But why do I get to sleep on the floor?

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:48.840
Hey, Duanmu

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:50.650
Can you find me a place to sleep?

00:11:50.659 --> 00:11:52.159
You're dead

00:11:52.159 --> 00:11:53.474
Why do you need sleep?

00:11:53.474 --> 00:11:55.094
That kinda makes sense

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:58.340
But when you're sleeping, what am I suppose to do?

00:11:58.340 --> 00:11:59.480
It's so boring

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:01.640
Do I sit here all night and watch you sleep?

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:03.280
Can you please don't be like that?

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:04.700
You call me when you need me

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.360
You shoo me off when you don't

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:08.460
You need to consider my feelings too

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:09.360
Bug off!

00:12:09.367 --> 00:12:13.023
You're free to roam wherever you like within the radius of 60 meters

00:12:15.985 --> 00:12:18.000
Yangming Master's Soul Image

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:28.220
Damn you!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:30.240
Trying to restrict my boundary

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:32.140
Only 60 meters

00:12:32.142 --> 00:12:34.520
I can't even leave this building, alright?

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:36.590
So boring

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.380
But on second thought

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:39.980
it's so unbelievable

00:12:39.985 --> 00:12:44.130
So many things happened in past 2 days

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.266
It feels so unreal

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:48.680
Suddenly becoming a Soul Image

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:52.890
I still don't understand anything about Yangming Master and Duanmu's family

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:55.000
Now on, what should I do?

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:58.210
Do I really need to live as a Soul Image?

00:12:58.219 --> 00:12:59.798
Is this

00:12:59.798 --> 00:13:02.609
the reason for me to stay in the living realm?

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:16.710
Is that it?

00:13:16.710 --> 00:13:18.660
As Yangming Master's Soul Image

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:20.460
I thought you'd be more powerful

00:13:20.469 --> 00:13:22.910
Turns out you're a weakling

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:25.030
Damn!

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:25.960
Who are you?

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:28.060
How dare you speak to me like this?

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:29.400
I see

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:31.570
Your boundary's restricted

00:13:31.570 --> 00:13:34.760
The amount of effort Duanmu puts for you

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:36.750
isn't so small

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:37.830
No wonder

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:39.700
your spiritual power

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:44.040
is so weak that I can only feel a teeny bit when I'm this close to you

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.310
This guy is dangerous

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:49.800
Stop wasting your strength

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:52.040
You can't escape here

00:13:52.342 --> 00:13:54.158
because your master

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:56.600
treats you like a dog

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:58.540
leashed by his side

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:00.220
Who the hell are you?

00:14:00.222 --> 00:14:02.014
That's not important

00:14:02.014 --> 00:14:05.857
because I'm no longer interested in you

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:06.800
Xiao Huayu

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:07.440
Yes

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:08.780
Lord Yinzhe

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:10.500
Finish him off

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:30.000
